{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55688","headline":"保安寺 · 江景防","name":"保安寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扰扰尘埃白日忙，偶然来谒赞公房。\n行登峻岭跻攀倦，坐俯清泉笑傲凉。\n林静鸟声酧客语，风来花气逐人香。\n此时已觉凡尘断，分得高僧兴味长。\n（见《宋诗纪事补遗》卷二引《开化县志》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"江景防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55688.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55688","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}